// Medications — each Care Plan medication picks one or more of these anchor times; "other" carries its
// own clock time (med.otherTime) instead of riding a house-standard time. Today's Flow and the Daily
// Care Log both key logged status off medAnchorsForMed()'s "anchor" strings, so a medication given at
// both breakfast and dinner tracks two independent Pass/Refuse records, not one shared status.
const MEDICATION_TIME_OPTIONS = [
