// Deferring to the next tick lets the browser finish dispatching the current click/tap before the
// DOM gets rebuilt. Without this, committing a text field's value on blur (which re-renders) can
// destroy the very button a caregiver is mid-click on if they tap a chip right after typing —
// the click silently doesn't register and it looks like the app "ate" the tap.
function scheduleRender(){ setTimeout(render, 0); }
