      </div>` : `
      <div class="tag-list">
        <span class="tag">Breakfast ${formatTime12(currentHouseMealTimes().breakfast)}</span>
        <span class="tag">Lunch ${formatTime12(currentHouseMealTimes().lunch)}</span>
        <span class="tag">Dinner ${formatTime12(currentHouseMealTimes().dinner)}</span>
      </div>`}
    </div>

    <div class="card" style="padding:16px 20px; margin-top:14px;">
      <div class="section-head" style="margin-bottom:4px;">
        <h2 style="font-size:13.5px;">Dietary Needs &amp; Special Instructions</h2>
        <span class="hint">Standing restrictions &amp; allergies come from each resident's Care Plan. Any caregiver can add a one-off instruction — a house manager or leadership addition applies right away, a caregiver's addition needs a house manager's approval first.</span>
